{"title": "Lump's War Horn", "pageid": 14351, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Lump's_War_Horn", "categories": ["Misc items", "Story items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-story\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Lumps_War_Horn_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Lumps_War_Horn_Icon.png/300px-Lumps_War_Horn_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/a/ae/Lumps_War_Horn_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Lump's War Horn image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Lumps_War_Horn_Icon.png/300px-Lumps_War_Horn_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Lumps_War_Horn_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">Lump's War Horn</span></a> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Story_Item\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Story Item\">Story Item</a> that can be given to the party by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lump\" title=\"Lump\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Lump.png/25px-Portrait_Lump.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Lump.png/38px-Portrait_Lump.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Lump.png/50px-Portrait_Lump.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lump the Enlightened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Lump.png/25px-Portrait_Lump.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Portrait_Lump.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lump\" title=\"Lump\">Lump the Enlightened</a>.\n\nSound this horn to call Lump's frenzied band of ogres. They will feast on anyone they can get their hands on, but if you've made a deal with them, they will make an effort to spare your party.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A simple horn belonging to Lump the Enlightened. The mouthpiece is crusty with chunks of dried food.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Story Item\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">Story Item</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 2 kg (4 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 2 kg (4 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 25 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  25  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-15e56278ac20de7eEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-b4b648232495330aEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-07d42fe04467c851END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_Horn_Ogres</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_Horn_Ogres\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_Horn_Ogres\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">fffed42d-f849-47ad-9931-3f7fe72e364c</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:fffed42d-f849-47ad-9931-3f7fe72e364c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:fffed42d-f849-47ad-9931-3f7fe72e364c\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">OBJ_Music_Horn</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:OBJ_Music_Horn+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:OBJ_Music_Horn+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<ul><li>Summon <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lump\" title=\"Lump\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Lump.png/25px-Portrait_Lump.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Lump.png/38px-Portrait_Lump.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Lump.png/50px-Portrait_Lump.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lump\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Lump.png/25px-Portrait_Lump.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Portrait_Lump.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lump\" title=\"Lump\">Lump</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chock\" title=\"Chock\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Chock.png/25px-Portrait_Chock.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Chock.png/38px-Portrait_Chock.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Chock.png/50px-Portrait_Chock.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Chock\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Chock.png/25px-Portrait_Chock.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/df/Portrait_Chock.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Chock\" title=\"Chock\">Chock</a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fank\" title=\"Fank\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_Fank.png/25px-Portrait_Fank.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_Fank.png/38px-Portrait_Fank.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_Fank.png/50px-Portrait_Fank.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fank\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_Fank.png/25px-Portrait_Fank.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d9/Portrait_Fank.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fank\" title=\"Fank\">Fank</a> to join the current conflict as neutral combatants who fight for the party.<sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\"><i>[<a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Notes\">See Notes</a>]</i></sup></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Given by Lump - on hiring his Ogres in the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blighted_Village\" title=\"Blighted Village\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blighted Village\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Blighted_Village\" title=\"Blighted Village\">Blighted Village</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Usage:\n<ul><li>The horn only summons Lump and his fellow Ogres in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a>.\n<ul><li>This includes the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a>, but <i>not</i> the <a href=\"/wiki/Rosymorn_Monastery_Trail\" title=\"Rosymorn Monastery Trail\">Rosymorn Monastery Trail</a>.</li>\n<li>The horn will work if the party returns to Act One after leaving it.</li>\n<li>If the party is in arrears when they leave Act One, Lump and his associates arrive to collect payment.</li></ul></li>\n<li>If the horn is blown and there are none besides the party in the area for Lump and his associates to fight, they will turn on the party.</li>\n<li>If the horn is blown and the only creatures nearby are not hostile to the party, Lump and his fellow ogres will fight the nearby creatures, starting a combat session where the creatures are hostile to both the party and the ogres.</li>\n<li>Once combat begins, the ogres show as un-affiliated combatants, highlighted in yellow. Therefore, spells and effects which (only) function on allies will not work on them.</li>\n<li>Once Lump and his band finish a fight, a new or better incentive must be offered and accepted to keep the horn functional and be able to call upon Lump and his associates again.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<ul><li>Voice Lines:\n<ul><li>Blowing the horn outside of Act One prompts the following lines:\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Custom\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Custom\">Custom Origin</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Minthara\" title=\"Minthara\">Minthara</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Minsc\" title=\"Minsc\">Minsc</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Jaheira\" title=\"Jaheira\">Jaheira</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Halsin\" title=\"Halsin\">Halsin</a>: \"I'm far beyond ogre ears.\"</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\">Astarion</a>: \"The ogres can't hear me. And I can't smell them. A fair trade, I say.\"</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\">Karlach</a>: \"They can't hear the horn. We'll have to fight our own battles.\"</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Lae%27zel\" title=\"Lae'zel\">Lae'zel</a>: \"The ogre won't come. I am well out of range.\"</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\">Gale</a>: \"No ogres. Stands to reason the sound of this primitive tool doesn't carry very far.\"</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\">Shadowheart</a>: \"No sense in bursting my lungs on this horn. The ogres are too far away to hear it.\"</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\">Wyll</a>: \"Yoo-hoo! Hellooooooo? Guess he can't hear me.\"</li></ul></li>\n<li>Blowing the horn once the ogres are dead prompts the following lines:\n<ul><li>Custom Origin: \"It's a nice horn - but useless now\"</li>\n<li>Astarion: \"Oh well. Worth a toot.\"</li>\n<li>Gale: \"Why bother? The dead can't hear my summons.\"</li>\n<li>Karlach: \"The ogres are dead. It's a mercy I didn't summon their shambling corpses.\"</li>\n<li>Lae'zel: \"Useless. The ogres are dead.\"</li>\n<li>Minthara, Custom Origin (sometimes): \"You can't summon a dead ogre, it turns out.\"</li>\n<li>Shadowheart: \"Doesn't matter how loud the horn's blown - dead ogres can't hear it.\"</li>\n<li>Wyll: \"What was I thinking? I can't summon a dead ogre!\"</li></ul></li>\n<li>Blowing the horn at camp prompts the following lines:\n<ul><li>Custom Origin: \"Nothing. It's... not really the time for an ogre rampage, anyhow.\"</li>\n<li>Astarion: \"Perhaps it's better the ogres aren't coming. I'm sure they snore.\"</li>\n<li>Gale: \"No response? Ogres aren't the types to enjoy a quiet night by the fire, I suppose.\"</li>\n<li>Karlach: \"The ogres aren't coming. Good. They'd wreck the camp.\"</li>\n<li>Lae'zel: \"No ogres. Surely for the best.\"</li>\n<li>Shadowheart: \"Hmm. Probably best to <i>not</i> have ogres traipsing through the camp, come to think of it...\"</li>\n<li>Wyll: \"No ogres. Good thing, too - they'd rip the camp to shreds.\"</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 209.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 207.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Jane-katsubo-horn-ogre.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Concept art by Jane Katsubo\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Jane-katsubo-horn-ogre.jpg/311px-Jane-katsubo-horn-ogre.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Jane-katsubo-horn-ogre.jpg/466px-Jane-katsubo-horn-ogre.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Jane-katsubo-horn-ogre.jpg/621px-Jane-katsubo-horn-ogre.jpg.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Concept art by Jane Katsubo\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Jane-katsubo-horn-ogre.jpg/311px-Jane-katsubo-horn-ogre.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"208\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Jane-katsubo-horn-ogre.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Concept art by Jane Katsubo</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202547\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.075 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.080 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2610/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 43253/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 15922/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 27/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip p